A. Notice and posting shall be provided as indicated in Sections 19.12.030 and 19.12.110F for the following tree removal permits:1. Mature specimen trees with single trunk over twenty-four inches DBH or for multi-trunk over forty-eight inches DBH;
2. Heritage trees;
